      "html": "\n      <div id=\"heroMedia\" class=\"carousel slide nx nx-hero\" data-bs-ride=\"false\">\n        <div class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#heroMedia\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Diapositiva 1\"></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#heroMedia\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\" aria-label=\"Diapositiva 2\"></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#heroMedia\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\" aria-label=\"Diapositiva 3\"></button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n          <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n            <div class=\"nx-hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('img/rubros/barberia/hero-1.jpg')\">\n              <div class=\"container\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n                <h2 class=\"nx-display\">Cortes con <span class=\"em\">oficio y estilo.</span></h2>\n                <p class=\"nx-lead\">Barbería clásica con mirada actual, en el corazón de Palermo.</p>\n                <div class=\"nx-pills\">\n                  <span class=\"nx-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> Turnos sin espera</span>\n                  <span class=\"nx-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-scissors\"></i> Barberos con oficio</span>\n                  <span class=\"nx-pill\"><i class=\"bi bi-cup-hot\"></i> Café de cortesía</span>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"btn-nx mt-4\" href=\"mailto:hola@example.com\">Reservá tu turno <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n            <div class=\"nx-hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('img/rubros/barberia/hero-2.jpg')\">\n              <div class=\"container\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n                <h2 class=\"nx-display\">Un lugar para <span class=\"em\">tomarte tu tiempo.</span></h2>\n                <p class=\"nx-lead\">Sillones clásicos, buena música y la charla de siempre.</p>\n                <a class=\"btn-nx mt-4\" href=\"mailto:hola@example.com\">Reservá tu turno <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n            <div class=\"nx-hero-slide\" style=\"background-image:url('img/rubros/barberia/hero-3.jpg')\">\n              <div class=\"container\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n                <h2 class=\"nx-display\">Barba perfilada <span class=\"em\">a navaja.</span></h2>\n                <p class=\"nx-lead\">Toalla caliente, aceites y un acabado prolijo.</p>\n                <a class=\"btn-nx mt-4\" href=\"mailto:hola@example.com\">Reservá tu turno <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n              </div></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"carousel-control-prev\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#heroMedia\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\"><span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Anterior</span></button>\n        <button class=\"carousel-control-next\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#heroMedia\" data-bs-slide=\"next\"><span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Siguiente</span></button>\n      </div>\n    "
