    {
      "id": "reserva-turno-media",
      "width": "full",
      "html": "<div class=\"nx nx-pad\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row g-4 g-lg-5 align-items-start\" data-booking>\n          <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n            <p class=\"nx-kicker\">Turnos online</p>\n            <h2 class=\"nx-display\">Elegí tu horario <span class=\"em\">y vení directo</span></h2>\n            <p class=\"nx-lead\">Mirá los turnos libres de la semana y reservá tu lugar en el sillón.</p>\n            <ul class=\"bk-perks\">\n              <li><span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-check\"></i></span><div><strong>Confirmación al instante</strong><p>Te llega un email con todos los datos.</p></div></li>\n              <li><span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-bell\"></i></span><div><strong>Recordatorio un día antes</strong><p>Te avisamos por WhatsApp.</p></div></li>\n              <li><span class=\"nx-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-arrow-repeat\"></i></span><div><strong>Reprogramás sin costo</strong><p>Hasta 24 h antes del turno.</p></div></li>\n            </ul>\n            <p class=\"bk-alt\">¿Preferís coordinar por mensaje? <a href=\"mailto:hola@example.com\">Escribinos</a></p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n            <form class=\"bk-card\" data-book-form data-book-requires=\"dia,horario\">\n              <div data-book-hide-on-done>\n                <p class=\"bk-label\"><span>1</span> Elegí el día</p>\n                <div class=\"bk-days\" data-book-days data-count=\"6\"></div>\n                <p class=\"bk-label\"><span>2</span> Elegí el horario</p>\n                <div class=\"bk-slots\" data-book-slots><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">09:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\" disabled>09:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">10:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">10:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\" disabled>11:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">12:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">15:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">15:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\" disabled>16:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">17:00</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">17:30</button><button class=\"bk-slot\" type=\"button\" data-book-pick=\"horario\">18:00</button></div>\n                <p class=\"bk-label\"><span>3</span> Tus datos</p>\n                <div class=\"row g-2\">\n                  <label class=\"bk-field col-sm-6\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Nombre y apellido</span><input class=\"bk-input\" name=\"nombre\" required placeholder=\"Nombre y apellido\" autocomplete=\"name\" data-book-field=\"nombre\"></label>\n                  <label class=\"bk-field col-sm-6\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Email</span><input class=\"bk-input\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"tu@email.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" data-book-field=\"email\"></label>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bk-foot\">\n                  <p class=\"bk-pick\"><i class=\"bi bi-calendar-event\"></i> <span data-book-out=\"dia\" data-empty=\"Elegí un día\"></span> · <span data-book-out=\"horario\" data-empty=\"sin horario\"></span></p>\n                  <button class=\"btn-nx\" type=\"submit\">Confirmar turno <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-right\"></i></button>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"bk-msg\" data-book-msg role=\"status\"></p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"bk-done\" data-book-done hidden role=\"status\">\n                <span class=\"bk-done-ico\"><i class=\"bi bi-check-lg\"></i></span>\n                <h3>¡Nos vemos en el sillón!</h3>\n                <p>Te esperamos el <b data-book-out=\"dia\"></b> a las <b data-book-out=\"horario\"></b>. Te mandamos la confirmación a <b data-book-out=\"email\"></b>.</p>\n                <button class=\"btn-nx-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-book-reset>Reservar otro turno</button>\n              </div>\n            </form>\n            <p class=\"nx-note\">Horarios y reserva de ejemplo.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"
